DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T200000
UID:01822f33b1a0bcf0677740c3754259e7@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Holiday Fun on the Petaluma River! Watch beautifully decorated
  boats of all types and sizes cruise the Petaluma River\, ushering in the 
 holiday season! This free event\, produced by the Petaluma Yacht Club\, fe
 atures everything from stand-up paddleboards to power and sail boats. Seve
 ral thousand holiday-lovers line the shore to for the spectacle\, so come 
 early to ensure the best view!
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/petaluma-s-lighted
 -boat-parade
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
